From 662e1149aa69693f2a9f3fd867ba477be02e8c13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 16:05:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD terminal visual yanks so users can copy pane text

TerminalUi tracks visible left and right pane lines plus the focused chat cursor so visual, visual-line, and visual-block selections can be highlighted and yanked through OSC 52. TerminalApp feeds the current render context before modal keys so bytewise arrows, pane metadata rows, and clipboard prefixes behave consistently.
